 "notModeled": [
  "analog input (0 V to Vref, pseudo-differential), internal 4.096-V reference and buffer: the result is always the 0 V code 0000h",
  "the conversion starts at the CONVST falling edge only while CS is low (tsu1 20 ns); the model starts it at every CONVST falling edge regardless of CS",
  "self-clearing reset: a CONVST falling edge with CS low, or a CS falling edge, while the internal convert state is high resets the converter (output latches cleared, BUSY low) (p.22)",
  "the first three conversions after power-up load factory trim data and are invalid (p.22)",
  "byte mode: the terminal table (p.8-9) gives D7-D2 on DB15-DB10 and all ones on DB9-DB0 with BYTE high (a copy of the 18-bit ADS8481 table); the model follows Table 2 and the Reading Data text (p.22): D7-D0 on DB15-DB8, all ones on DB7-DB0",
  "tAcc / tDf use ten / tdis 30 ns max at +VBD = 3 V (20 ns at 5 V); the 3-V table prints t(CONV) typ as 67 ns (typo for 670)",
  "sampling start, acquisition time, quiet zone around CONVST falling (50 ns before, 40 ns after); reading during a conversion returns the previous result on the part"
 ],
